  << /ActualText (Export sales were the largest single driver of the shortfall\054 at 93\0564\045 below budget pending NEXIM facility disbursement\054 this emerged due to trade disruptions due to war\056 Local Trades also under\055shot at 47\0565\045 below budget\056 Projects was the one bright spot\054 closing H1 at 49\0561\045 ahead of budget\056)
