  << /ActualText (Agriarche\047s fintech model extends beyond input financing to deliver a broader suite of financial and trade services tailored to rural agricultural communities\056 While input financing is a key component\054 the platform is designed to facilitate deposits\054 payments\054 trade transactions\054 and other financial products that support the agricultural value chain\056)
