9534 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Logistics costs have doubled over a 2 year period from an average of 650k to 1\0563m per truck and this has placed pressure on our gross margins\056 Immediate ways to cope are to increase vols\054 diversify more to exports and reduce other costs\056 There are also not as many available trucks during harvest seasons to maximize our potential especially in areas with high volumes of commodities\056)
     /K [ 228 ]
     /P 9535 0 R
     /Pg 9080 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

